<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Brew Haven</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
      background-color: #111;
      color: #fff;
    }
    header {
      background-color: #000;
      padding: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav a {
      color: #d4af37;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
    }
    nav a:hover {
      color: #fff;
    }
    .hero {
      background: url('https://png.pngtree.com/background/20230519/original/pngtree-an-old-coffee-shop-with-very-dark-walls-picture-image_2652909.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
      height: 80vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 3em;
      color: #d4af37;
    }
    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.2em;
      max-width: 600px;
      color: #d4af37;
    }
    .products {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-around;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      padding: 50px 20px;
      background-color: #1a1a1a;
    }
    .product {
      width: 300px;
      text-align: center;
      margin: 20px;
      border: 1px solid #333;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #222;
      transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }
    .product:hover {
      transform: translateY(-10px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
    }
    .product h3 {
      color: #d4af37;
    }
    .order-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 15px;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      background-color: #d4af37;
      color: #000;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 5px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    }
    .order-btn:hover {
      background-color: #fff;
      color: #d4af37;
    }
    footer {
      background-color: #000;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #aaa;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <nav>
      <a href="#">Home</a>
      <a href="#">Products</a>
      <a href="#">Locations</a>
      <a href="#">Contact</a>
      <a href="#">Sign In</a>
      <a href="#">Order Online</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Brew Haven</h1>
    <p>Each batch is carefully roasted to highlight the unique characteristics of the beans.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="products">
    <div class="product">
      <img src="D:\html and css\panel_1.png" height="250px" width="250px">
      <h3>Colombian Supremo</h3>
      <p>Rich and balanced flavor with a smooth finish.</p>
      <a href="#" class="order-btn">Order Now</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product">
      <img src="D:\html and css\panel_2.png" height="250px" width="250px">
      <h3>Dark Roast Espresso</h3>
      <p>Bold, intense, and full-bodied for espresso lovers.</p>
      <a href="#" class="order-btn">Order Now</a>
    </div>
    <div class="product">
      <img src="D:\html and css\panel_3.png" height="250px" width="250px">
      <h3>Ethiopian Yirgacheffe</h3>
      <p>Floral aroma with bright citrus notes.</p>
      <a href="#" class="order-btn">Order Now</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Brew Haven | Crafted with Passion</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
